1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:07,183
UAE corporate tax.

2
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:23,481
Under Ministerial Decision eighty-four of twenty twenty-five, taxable persons with revenue above fifty million dirhams, and qualifying free zone persons, must prepare and maintain audited financial statements.

3
00:00:23,481 --> 00:00:30,049
It applies to tax periods starting on or after the first of January twenty twenty-five.

4
00:00:30,749 --> 00:00:37,106
Check your revenue against the threshold, and book the audit early enough for the tax return.

5
00:00:37,806 --> 00:00:42,276
Our corporate tax advisory helps you plan both timelines.

6
00:00:42,276 --> 00:00:44,158
Close to the threshold?

7
00:00:44,158 --> 00:00:46,041
